    "body": "I must admit I'm not entirely sure what exact use case you have in mind, but indeed most might certainly be handled on their own with alternative proposals. For instance I think `@container` does solve a lot of cases where before one needed to use computed boxes in JS. Your proposed solution makes me think of https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/8982 which would also help solve a bunch of other use cases, though still not the whole problem.",
